taskDescriptions.get_coa_sync_report='Get the stable private Excel download path for the current preview or execution results. The one-sheet workbook shows only changes and issues; unchanged items are omitted. include_rows returns the same six report columns for creating a downloadable chat attachment. No Manager writes. Resolve the relative path against this Site origin; never expose another user task.';
taskDescriptions.refresh_coa_sync='Retain and refresh an expired draft, or prepare only failed/conflicting/pending items from a previous sync. Reconcile uncertain writes by reading; never retry unresolved writes or recreate successful items. New differences require a fresh preview and approval. No Manager writes.';
